    "detailed_description": "FantasyKingdom is an exciting hidden object puzzle game in a fantasy\u2013medieval setting.<br />\r\nThis game is a great way to relax after a hard day and get away from problems.  Intuitive gameplay and a calm atmosphere does not bother the player and allows you to immediately immerse yourself in the process.<br />\r\nMelodious light music creates an atmosphere of tranquility and mystery in the game.<br />\r\nSome items will be easier to find. And some items will have to work hard to find! There are many items on the location, there are numerous trading tents, fortress walls, village houses and other medieval decorations. The player must explore every part of the location to find the necessary items.",
